{"results":[{"url":"https://x.com/thewire_in/status/1320689623056613379","final_url":"https://x.com/thewire_in/status/1320689623056613379","title":"The Wire (@thewire_in) on X","description":"A 2016 article from our website was misinterpreted via a misleading screenshot, claiming that we referred to the festival of Durga Puja as 'racist' and called the Hindu goddess a 'sex worker'.\n\nAs fact-checked by @AltNews, the claim stands wrong.\n\nhttps://t.co/4LdTW4kQGa","language":"en","text":"The Wire on X: \"A 2016 article from our website was misinterpreted via a misleading screenshot, claiming that we referred to the festival of Durga Puja as 'racist' and called the Hindu goddess a 'sex worker'.\nAs fact-checked by @AltNews, the claim stands wrong.\nhttps://t.co/4LdTW4kQGa\"\n\nA 2016 article from our website was misinterpreted via a misleading screenshot, claiming that we referred to the festival of Durga Puja as 'racist' and called the Hindu goddess a 'sex worker'.\nAs fact-checked by @AltNews, the claim stands wrong.\n\nA 2016 article from our website was misinterpreted via a misleading screenshot, claiming that we referred to the festival of Durga Puja as 'racist' and called the Hindu goddess a 'sex worker'.\nAs fact-checked by @AltNews, the claim stands wrong.","author":"https://x.com/thewire_in","published_date":"2020-10-26T11:31:58.000Z","latency_ms":445.53957699099556,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}